  'The financial liability of shareholders is strictly limited to their individual capital contribution in the company, shielding personal assets and private wealth from commercial liabilities.': 'The financial liability of shareholders is strictly limited to their individual capital contribution in the company, shielding personal assets and private wealth from commercial liabilities.',
